<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Scientific.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it downgraded Boston Scientific Corp to accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- said it expects Boston Scientific to underperform until &quot;earnings visibility is more certain.&quot;</p>
<p>-- cut the 1997 earnings estimate to $1.98 a share from $2.13 a share and trimmed the 1998 estimate to $2.72 a share from $2.88 a share.</p>
<p>-- Boston Scientific said Thursday it expects its first quarter earnings to be below analysts' expectations of $0.47 per share, since currency fluctuations hurt revenues.</p>
<p>-- Boston Scientific lost 14 to 46-1/2.</p>
</text>
